id: angelic-offense
name: Angelic Offense
order: 4
category: mind
importance: secondary
description: >
  In the midst of battle, you instinctively launch attacks and counterattacks with speed and precision, sending your enemies reeling.
text: >
  Angelic Offense (Mind): In the midst of battle, you instinctively launch attacks and counterattacks with speed and precision, sending your enemies reeling.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are above the Injured Health Threshold, halve the penalties you receive from Diminishing Offense.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may spend a Counter Maneuver to make a Clash (Impulsive/Cognitive) against that Opponent. If you win, they suffer from the Guard Down Combat Condition against the next Attacking Maneuver that targets them this Combat Round.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you receive no Damage from an Attacking Maneuver that targeted you while you had no Counter Actions, you may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you Defeat an Opponent or knock them through a Health Threshold with an Attacking Maneuver while you are above the Injured Health Threshold, you may gain a Counter Action.

---

[passive]
# (1) Above Injured: Healthy or Bruised. The penalty halved, rounded down.
if (!belowThreshold("injured")) {
    diminishing.offense.penalty *= 0.5;
}

# (2) An Opponent hit by your Attacking Maneuver: offered on the attack's card, once a Round, with a Counter Action left -
# "a Counter Maneuver" read as a Counter Action. The Clash read as Thrust's "(Impulsive/Corporeal)" is: either Saving
# Throw, each side's choice; won, Guard Down on them till the next Attacking Maneuver aimed at them has been answered, this Combat Round
# (chat.mjs angelicOffenseButtons, settleAngelicOffense).
allow angelic.offenseClash;

# (3) An Attacking Maneuver that left you without Damage, made at you while you had no Counter Action left: the Basic
# Attack offered on its card out of sequence, once a Round, counted when taken (chat.mjs offerAngelicCounter).
allow angelic.counterAttack;

# (4) An Opponent knocked through a Health Threshold, or Defeated, by your Attacking Maneuver - once between the two, a
# Round - in Healthy or Bruised. Automatic by default; set Triggered, asked in a window as it happens.
[triggered/knock-through, 1/round, effect 4]
requires !belowThreshold("injured");
actions.counterGained += 1;

[triggered/defeat-opponent, 1/round, effect 4]
requires !belowThreshold("injured");
actions.counterGained += 1;
